<title>FRANCE: One ship loading 7,000 tns flour in Rouen.</title>
<headline>One ship loading 7,000 tns flour in Rouen.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>One ship was currently loading some 7,000 tonnes of flour in Rouen, port officials said on Tuesday. The flour was destined for West Africa, they said.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5432</p>
</text>
